e="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">determination of the concrete grades, wall thicknesses</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">and reinforcement,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">preparation of the execution drawings</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Handover digitally and in [PERSON_097] (3 copies).</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Structural analysis</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2232" RNoPart="0013"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Inlet structure of reinforced concrete,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">according to enclosed drawing,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">incl. structurally required reinforcement</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">supply and place properly</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Wall thickness at least 20 cm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Structure consisting of :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Base slab 3,00 x 1,20 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rear wall 1,00 x 2,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Side walls 2 x 0,80 x 2,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Side walls sloping  2 x 2,00 / 0,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">incl. socket for reinforced concrete pipe DN 800 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Manufacturer :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">[FIRMA_084] &amp; Co. KG</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betonwarenfabriken</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Stolzenseeweg 9</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">88353 Kisslegg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tel. [TELEFON_077]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">or equivalent manufacturer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Remark :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Galvanised steel grating is not part</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">of the tender and is assembled by others on site</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Inlet structure, precast element</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id2044" RNoPart="04"><LblTx><p><span>Hourly-rate work (daywork)</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id2045"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Preliminary remark workers:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">The charge-out rate contains all</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">expenses, the actual wage</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">and any capital-forming bene-</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">fits with the surcharges for overheads,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">social fund contributions and the like,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">as well as ancillary wage and salary costs.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Surcharges for night, Sunday and public holiday</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">work are, however, not included in the price.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Preliminary remark</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2046" RNoPart="0001"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Leading hand (foreman)</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Leading hand (foreman)</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2047" RNoPart="0002"><Qty>20.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Senior skilled worker</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Senior [PERSON_020]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2048" RNoPart="0003"><Qty>20.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Skilled worker</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Skilled worker</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id2049"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Preliminary remark equipment and vehicles:</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">The charge-out rate contains all</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">expenses for the deployment,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">availability and operating supplies costs,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">as well as all surcharges, including</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">the costs for the operating personnel.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Preliminary remark</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2050" RNoPart="0004"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Van</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Van</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2051" RNoPart="0005"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Mini excavator up to 0,4 m3</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Mini excavator</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2052" RNoPart="0006"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Excavator up to 1 m3</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Excavator up to 1 m3</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2053" RNoPart="0007"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Truck up to 12 to payload</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Truck up to 12 to payload</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy></BoQBody></BoQ></Award></GAEB>